cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the Version 3 findings, please cite the v3.0.0 release. The Zenodo concept DOI identifies the version family."
title: "Voynich Transition Grammar: Boundary-Aware Token-Structure Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Laird"
    given-names: "Amy"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-5479-0007"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible corpus-analysis code, frozen inputs, generated results, tests,
  and audit records for boundary-aware token-structure analysis of the
  Voynich Manuscript. Version 3 replaces the Version 2 prefix/suffix estimator
  with an exact within-unit composition-conditioned ordering baseline,
  boundary-safe comparator tokenization, and page-block Voynich robustness.
  The project makes no decipherment, translation, language-identification, or
  natural-language-uniqueness claim.
